bring in the math lib
display "1: bring in — " + double(5)

-- Now test with models.esu
include the models
alice is a new person with name "Alice" and age 30
display "2: include — " + alice.name

-- Test other forms by re-importing (already cached, no error)
using the math lib
display "3: using — " + triple(3)

